<div class="ai-grid"><div><div class="ai-card"><h3 style="margin-top:0"><i class="fa fa-magic text-purple"></i> AI-Powered DR Detection</h3><p class="text-muted">Upload a fundus photograph for automated diabetic retinopathy screening. Our AI model will analyze the image and provide DR grading with confidence scores.</p><label>Eye</label><div class="ai-eye"><label class="active"><input type="radio" name="ai_eye" value="OD" checked> <strong>OD</strong><small class="text-muted" style="display:block">Right Eye</small></label><label><input type="radio" name="ai_eye" value="OS"> <strong>OS</strong><small class="text-muted" style="display:block">Left Eye</small></label></div><input type="file" id="fundusInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png" style="display:none"><div id="uploadArea" class="ai-upload"><i class="fa fa-cloud-upload fa-3x text-muted"></i><p>Click to upload fundus image</p><small class="text-muted">JPEG, PNG up to 10MB</small></div><img id="fundusPreview" class="ai-preview" alt="Fundus"><button id="removeImage" type="button" class="btn btn-danger btn-xs" style="display:none;margin-top:7px">Remove image</button><button id="analyzeImage" type="button" disabled class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="background:#5e35b1;border-color:#5e35b1;margin-top:15px;padding:11px"><span class="ai-spinner"><i class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Analyzing...</span><span class="ai-button-label"><i class="fa fa-magic"></i> Analyze Image</span></button></div><div class="ai-guide"><strong>Image Guidelines</strong><ul style="margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px"><li>Use high-quality fundus photographs</li><li>Ensure adequate illumination and focus</li><li>Macula should be centered in the image</li><li>Avoid images with significant artifacts</li><li>Minimum resolution: 1024x1024 pixels</li></ul></div></div>
